# The loop's verification record (.loop) IS tracked — the verdicts, receipts,
# tickets and DEPLOY_RUNBOOK are the audit trail for safety-critical work and
# cannot be regenerated. The evidence screenshots CAN be: every one of them is
# produced by re-running a probe in scratchpad/, so 3.5M of PNGs stay out of git.
.loop/EVIDENCE/

# Operational state from bin/dns-guard.sh — machine- and time-specific.
